  "text": "\r\n<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN\" >\r\n<HTML>\r\n  <!--%@ OutputCache Duration=60 VaryByParam=\"flora_id;taxon_id\"  %-->\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n<!-- Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':\r\nnew Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],\r\nj=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=\r\n'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);\r\n})(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-TGK4SMV');</script>\r\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager -->\r\n<title>Zantedeschia in Flora of Pakistan @ efloras.org</title>\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href='/templates/eflora.css' />\r\n<script src=\"JavaScript/eflora.js\" type=\"text/javascript\" ></script>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n\r\n  <!-- body onload=\"formMOMap.submit()\" -->\r\n  <body>\r\n\r\n    <TABLE id=\"TableMain\" cellSpacing=\"1\" cellPadding=\"1\" width=\"640\" border=\"0\">\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD><!--%@ Register TagPrefix=\"ucFlora\" TagName=\"TaxonSearchBox\" Src=\"TaxonSearchBox.ascx\" %-->\r\n\r\n<script language=\"javascript\">\r\n\r\nfunction jsClearTextBox(sender)\r\n{\r\n  // alert(formSearchBox[\"name_str\"].id);\r\n  // alert(sender.value);\r\n  if (sender.value == \"taxon name\")\r\n  {\r\n    sender.value = \"\";\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n</script>\r\n<table id=\"ucEfloraHeader_tableHeaderWrapper\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<TD style=\"WIDTH: 479px\"><a id=\"ucEfloraHeader_linkFloraHome\" title=\"Flora Homepage\" href=\"flora_page.aspx?flora_id=5\"><img src=\"images/flora/eflora-logo-5.gif\" id=\"ucEfloraHeader_imageLogo\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Link to Flora of Pakistan home\" /><br>\r\n        </a></TD>\r\n\t\t<TD valign=\"bottom\" align=\"right\">\r\n      <div id=\"ucEfloraHeader_panelSearchBox\">\r\n\t\t\t <!-- begin of search box -->\r\n        <FORM name=\"formSearchBox\" action=\"browse.aspx\" method=\"get\">\r\n          <TABLE borderColor=\"#ccffcc\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"2\" width=\"200\" border=\"1\">\r\n            <TR>\r\n              <TD>\r\n                <span id=\"ucEfloraHeader_lblSearchBox\"><INPUT TYPE='Hidden' NAME='flora_id' ' id='flora_id' VALUE='5' >\n&nbsp;<input id=name_str name=name_str &nbsp;  value=''  class=small title='Use % as the wildcard\r\n(e.g. pinus % or pinus a%)'  onfocus='jsClearTextBox(this);' accessKey=s size=15> <input class=small type=submit value=Search name=btnSearch><br>\n <input name=chkAllFloras type=checkbox   > <span class=small>All Floras &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<A HREF='search_page.aspx?flora_id=5'  TARGET='_top'  class='a.link.small'>Advanced Search</A></span>\n</span></TD>\r\n            </TR>\r\n          </TABLE>\r\n        </FORM> <!-- end of search box -->\r\n      \r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    </TD>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdSubHeader\">\r\n<table id=\"FooterTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" id=\"footerTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"WIDTH: 291px\"> Page 6</td>\r\n          <TD align=\"right\">\r\n            <span id=\"ucEfloraSubHeader_lblLinks\"><a target='_top' href='/login.aspx'>Login</a>\n | <A HREF='/index.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >eFloras Home</A> | <A HREF='/help_page.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >Help</A></span></TD>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </TD>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdBody\">\r\n          <table id=\"tableBody\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td id=\"tdLeftBar\" valign=\"top\" width=\"0\"></td>\r\n\r\n              <td id=\"tdContent\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"1930\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td vAlign=\"top\">\r\n                      <table id=\"tableTaxonChain\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<td><span id=\"lblTaxonChain\"><font size=\"2\"><A HREF='flora_page.aspx?flora_id=5'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Flora homepage' >Pakistan</A> | <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=5'  TARGET='_top' >Family List</A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=10056'  TARGET='_top' >Araceae</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=5&start_taxon_id=10056'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A></font></span></td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <div id=\"panelTaxonTreatment\">\r\n\t\r\n                        <span id=\"lblTaxonDesc\"><!-- Default Template -->\r\n<b>Zantedeschia</b> Spreng., Syst. Veg.  3:765.  1826.  Bailey, Stand. Cycl. Hort. 6: 3534. 1917; C. Letty in Bothalia, 11: 5-26. 1973. \n<br><small>[nom. cons.]</small>\n \r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n<p>\r\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=128552' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Richardia</i>  Kunth</A><p>\r\n\r\nRhizomatous herbs. Leaves usually sagittate or hastate, sometimes spotted, long petioled. Spathe large and conspicuous, cuspidate. Spadix monoecious, with male flowers above. Perianth absent. Fruit a 1-3-loculed berry.<p>\r\n\r\n8-9 species, tropical and S. Africa. Represented in Pakistan by 1 cultivated species.<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<P>\r\n</span>\r\n                        <P><!-- Key -->\r\n                        </P> \r\n                        <P>\r\n                          <span id=\"lblLowerTaxonList\"><p>\n<B>Lower Taxon</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=200027345' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Zantedeschia</b> <b>aethiopica</b>  (Linn.) Spreng.</A></ul>\n<p>\n<p>\n<B>Related Synonym(s):</B><br>\n<ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=220002145' \n\tTITLE='Synonym' ><i>Calla</i> <i>aethiopica</i>  Linn. = <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=5&taxon_id=200027345' \n\tTITLE='Accepted Name' ><b>Zantedeschia</b> <b>aethiopica</b>  (Linn.) Spreng.</A></A></ul>\n<p>\n</span></P>\r\n                        <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                        <P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n                        \r\n                        <P></P>\r\n                      \r\n</div>\r\n                      <P><div id=\"panelTaxonLinks\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</P>\r\n                      <P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableLinkList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\">\r\n\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n\t\t\t<TD><span id=\"lblLinkTitle\"><font size=\"2\"><b>Related Links</b> (opens in a new window)</font></span></TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <P><span id=\"lblLinkList\"><b>Treatments in Other Floras @ www.efloras.org</b><ul>\n<li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=3&taxon_id=135259'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Chinese Plant Names' >Chinese Plant Names</A><li><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=101&taxon_id=135259'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='treatment in Flora of Taiwan Checklist' >Flora of Taiwan Checklist</A></ul>\n<p>\n<b>Other Databases</b>\n<ul>\n\n<li><A HREF='http://mobot.mobot.org/cgi-bin/search_pick?name=Zantedeschia'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='W3TROPICOS' >W<SUP>3</SUP>TROPICOS</A>\n<li><A HREF='http://www.ipni.org/ipni/IpniServlet?family=&infrafamily=&genus=Zantedeschia&infragenus=&species=&infraspecies=&author_abbrev=&publication_title=&is_apni_record=on&is_gci_record=on&is_ik_record=on&include_authors=on&include_basionym_authors=on&query_type=by_query'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='IPNI' >IPNI</A>\n<li><A HREF='http://ravenel.si.edu/botany/ing//INGsearch.cfm?searchWord=Zantedeschia'  TARGET='FLORA_LINK' \n\tTITLE='ING' >ING Genus Search</A></ul>\n</span></P>\r\n                            </TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</table>\r\n\t\r\n                        \r\n</div></P>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td>\r\n                      <!-- Links -->\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <P><span id=\"lblEditLinks\"><font size=\"2\"></font></span></P>\r\n                      <P>\r\n                        <!-- Comment List --></P>\r\n                    </td>\r\n                  </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n              </td>\r\n              <TD id=\"tdRightBar\" valign=\"top\"></TD>\r\n\r\n            </tr>\r\n          </table>\r\n        </TD>\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <td>\r\n<table id=\"SubHeaderTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#99cc99\" id=\"SubHeaderTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <TD align=\"center\" bgColor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkHome\" href=\"index.aspx\" target=\"_top\">eFlora Home</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkPeopleSearch\" href=\"person_search.aspx\" target=\"_top\">People Search</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkHelp\" href=\"help_page.aspx\" target=\"_top\">Help</a>\r\n            &nbsp;|&nbsp;\r\n            <a id=\"ucEfloraFooter_linkActKey\" href=\"http://flora.huh.harvard.edu/china/ActKey\" target=\"_top\">ActKey</a>\r\n           